tion to the beach, amusement parks and skateparks, bringing the thrill of real-world locations into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track challenges you in a unique way, offering fresh racing experiences that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Room Games"],"dlc":[4042350],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/8b886179c202d7196e4fe0d21711dd7dce71c75f/header.jpg?t=1766247377","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/1729508707/afbd4df828ae5d58cb315237165ea3a2f814743f/1753716995/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753722028","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/1729508707/afbd4df828ae5d58cb315237165ea3a2f814743f/1753716995/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753722028","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/1729508707/afbd4df828ae5d58cb315237165ea3a2f814743f/1753716995/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753722028","id":257174938,"name":"Recharge - Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174938/2f4ba8e9e841ff55a9d4d98a56a9fbb2a9ccfe70/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753722028"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/512168826/e65c01a974b356cdd1b5d7973b73b030f407bafc/1751058651/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751060699","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/512168826/e65c01a974b356cdd1b5d7973b73b030f407bafc/1751058651/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751060699","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3225420/512168826/e65c01a974b356cdd1b5d7973b73b030f407bafc/1751058651/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751060699","id":2